    "text": "cbs2iowa.com\nwebsite\nCedar Falls\nCollege Team of the Century #8: 2005 UNI football\nBy Owen Siebring,\n13 hours agoCEDAR FALLS, Iowa — The top UNI team on our countdown is the #8 college team of the century: the 2005 UNI football team. That fall, the Panthers lost 3 games over the first month and a half of the season. But then closed the regular season with 3 wins over top-15 opponents.",
